.TH WERKMEISTER-PR-WATCH 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pr\-watch \- Resume each opening session once its PR merges, ships or closes (any workspace)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pr watch\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-install\fR
Install a schedule (launchd on macOS, else crontab) that runs \fBpr watch\fR every 10 minutes
.TP
\fB\-\-uninstall\fR
Remove that schedule
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
